        {
          "id": "b5ed3473-c9b5-41c5-b8bc-d01b3d5248c1",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "confront",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/kənˈfrʌnt/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "verb",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "正视；面对（挑战、困难、问题）",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Mr. Kamiya isn't confronting the world; he's confronting something that might make the world turn its head.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "神山先生并不是在正视整个世界，而是在直面可能让世界侧目之物。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 0,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.289Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.289Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "ce200932-9185-48dc-a17f-e43f8e93124e",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "comedian",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/kəˈmiː.di.ən/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "职业喜剧演员；讲笑话以娱乐观众的人",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "I believe comedians never truly retire.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "我相信喜剧演员永远不会真正退休。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B1"
          },
          "position": 1,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "50565478-6fa0-4cda-874b-f3b901ecc9b3",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "estimate",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˈes.tɪ.mət/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "估计；估算",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "What is a reasonable estimate for the limit of h at x=3?",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "h 在 x=3 处的极限的合理估计值是多少？",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 2,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "1e30e79c-353f-4117-a452-013725e26c1d",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "notation",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/noʊˈteɪʃən/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "符号表示法；记法",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "We also have a special notation to talk about limits.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "我们也有一种特殊的符号表示法来讨论极限。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 3,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "646f3d25-4268-49e0-a6e6-d30e02d60f38",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "infinitely",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˈɪn.fɪ.nɪt.li/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "adverb",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "无限地；无穷地",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "In limits, we want to get infinitely close.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "在极限中，我们希望无限地接近。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 4,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "a8a68a06-242b-4b78-9be4-9762892020a9",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "mastery",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˈmæs.tər.i/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "掌握程度；精通",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Course mastery: 0%",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "课程掌握度：0%",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 5,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "703373bc-56e7-4efe-8847-c4997eee6705",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "estimate",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˈes.tɪ.meɪt/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "verb",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "估计；估算；推算",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Estimating limit values from graphs",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "从图像中估算极限值",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 6,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "3aa669f4-30ab-4963-829b-c028084b224b",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "approximation",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/əˌprɒk.sɪˈmeɪ.ʃən/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "近似值；近似",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Just remember that we're dealing with an approximation, not an exact value.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "只要记住，我们处理的是近似值，而不是精确值。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 7,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "4bfc3024-052d-44db-b6b7-c97b01d981c1",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "zoom",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/zuːm/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "verb",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "放大；缩放",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "We could zoom in further to get a better approximation if we wanted.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "如果我们愿意，可以进一步放大以获得更好的近似值。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 8,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "ac6f147d-ccdc-4da0-afa4-3b70ba35b3b4",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "piecewise",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˈpiːs.waɪz/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "adjective",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "分段的（描述函数由多个子区间上的不同规则组成）",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Whenever you're dealing with a piecewise function, it's possible to get a graph like the one below.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "每当处理分段函数时，都有可能得到如下所示的图形。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 9,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "24ea3b0e-1063-4e8d-8a77-a4b6bb6ef209",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "takeaway",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˈteɪk.ə.weɪ/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "要点；结论",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Big takeaway: It's possible for the function value to be different from the limit value.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "重要要点：函数值有可能不同于极限值。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 10,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "af304687-289c-44ee-bd78-9601986ec65c",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "reinforce",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ˌriːɪnˈfɔːs/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "verb",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "加强；强化；使更有力",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Reinforcing the key idea: The function value at x=−4 is irrelevant to finding the limit.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "强化关键概念：x=−4 处的函数值与求极限无关。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 11,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "2d7b6d64-916f-4ee0-8c56-6d79c2b803e8",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "irrelevant",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/ɪˈrel.vənt/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "adjective",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "无关的；不相关的",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "The function value at x=−4 is irrelevant to finding the limit.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "函数在 x=−4 处的值与求极限无关。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 12,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "d0b7eb85-72d0-4234-9b58-d293727d46e3",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "flip",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/flɪp/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "noun",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "（on the flip side）另一方面；反之",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "On the flip side, when the function is defined for some x-value, that doesn't mean that the limit necessarily exists.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "另一方面，当函数在某个 x 值处有定义时，并不意味着极限一定存在。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B1"
          },
          "position": 13,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "ab13a577-1a0b-42d5-9ed8-6cccedb55290",
          "notebaseId": "497d74e7-c44b-4b06-a272-131009c4c5c8",
          "cells": {
            "85899c64-dec6-42dd-adf9-ae65611c3073": "slick",
            "519dccb8-7cf6-40e7-a5b6-f4d5526a6b46": "/slɪk/",
            "b0a33f04-4eb2-4ae7-a976-9f42cad27f35": "adjective",
            "af12d6d7-afad-447a-89a9-0d806beede07": "高科技的；功能强大的；精美的",
            "c7ceacfb-a22a-486a-b5ae-8679852daadf": "Graphing calculators are pretty slick these days.",
            "158e7baa-4062-4e2c-97cb-9575753488ac": "现在的图形计算器非常先进。",
            "fd209b8e-2b57-4b08-b150-13ed3e205718": "B2"
          },
          "position": 14,
          "createdAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-08-31T13:04:47.301Z"
        },
